 4. 🏈 1 sports thing: Ohio State leads preseason poll 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data : AP. Table: Axios Visuals Ohio State and Oregon lead AP's preseason college Top 25 , out at noon ET today.

 That gives the Big Ten the top two teams in the preseason rankings for only the second time. 💭 Thought bubble, from Axios college football superfan Donica Phifer: The preseason Top 25 is mostly guesswork and vibes. But one thing holds true: SEC bias remains strong. 

 Voters are giving some SEC teams, like Alabama (11-4 in 2025) , LSU (7-6) and Tennessee (8-5) , the benefit of the doubt. The Tigers haven't been in the playoffs since they won the whole thing in 2019. The less said about the Crimson Tide's 2026 Rose Bowl game, the better. And what did the Volunteers do that stood out last year? Not losing to Arkansas? Go deeper . 

 
 
